{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國多地發生騷亂前夕，總統馬克龍夫婦上周五（16日）在巴黎觀賞演唱會，被批評未有理會民眾不滿政府施政的聲音，有示威者形容二人猶如在法國大革命中被推翻斬首的國王路易十六及瑪麗王后。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:19:24.213777+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:53:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:35.690951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:44.994004+00:00","content_hash":"f4e87e6eb96a0746d14205def9ad8ab3c50104ac9500b4bbf46c77b373ac8692","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}